...
> Is there a way to plot the intercepts for the country and year?

There is a plot method that draws sort of a qqplot if that is what you want.
However, I am not sure of the syntax.

...
> the intercepts for the variable year are all 0. Is this normal?
> $year
>      (Intercept)
> 1965           0
> 1966           0
...

This might happen if estimated variance between the years is practically
zero. This would lead to complete shrinkage of years towards the prior mean,
which is zero. Perhaps there are also some problems with the structure of
data.

Regards, gg

